+---
+
+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch generation as `createPatch(from, to)` exported by `src/index.ts`.
+
+The function must accept JSON values, return a deterministic patch which `applyPatch` transforms from
+`from` into `to`, avoid mutating either input, and emit granular operations for local object and array
+changes rather than replacing an unchanged document wholesale. Document the public API and cover the
+behaviour with deterministic automated tests.
